'''Rescue Scarf''' (Japanese: '''レスキュースカーフ''' ''Rescue Scarf'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=If the Pokémon this card is attached to is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent's Pokémon, put it into your hand instead of the discard pile. 
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Rescue Scarf}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Rescue Scarf|115}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.

